ke an odd request... but I have a young ward who is quite shy.  You are a hero to him, and he asked me to get your hoofprint.',5851),(6059,0,'Trick or Treat!',342),(6092,0,'This Dimensional Imploder sounds dangerous!  How can I make one?',6092),(6094,0,'I must build a beacon for this marvelous device!',6094),(6187,0,'I execute him as per my liege\'s instructions, and do it in such a manner that he suffers painfully before he dies as retribution for his crimes against my people.',618701),(6187,1,'I execute him as per my liege\'s instructions, but doing so in as painless of a way as possible.  Justice must be served, but I can show some compassion.\n',618702),(6187,2,'I risk my own life and free him so that he may prove his innocence.  If I can, I\'ll help him in any way.',618703),(6208,0,'I confront the ruler on his malicious behavior, upholding my liege\'s honor at the risk of any future diplomacy.',620801),(6208,1,'I not-so-quietly ignore the insult, hoping to instill a fear in the ruler that he may have gaffed.  I then inform my liege of the insult when I return.',620802),(6208,2,'I quietly ignore the insult.  I will not tell my liege, as I am to secure peace at all costs.  It\'s only an insult - not a declaration of war.',618702),(6209,0,'I would speak against my brother joining the order, rushing a permanent breech in our relationship.  He would be a danger to himself and those around him, and that is too great a risk hoping he would improve over time.',620901),(6209,1,'I would speak for my brother joining the order, potentially risking the safety of the order.  I could help him with the order\'s regimens, and I\'d have faith in his ability to adapt and learn.',620902),(6209,2,'I would create some surreptitious means to keep my brother out of the order.  I can keep him out without him being any bit wiser, thereby saving our familial bonds.',620903),(6210,0,'I would show my liege the beast\'s ear and claim the beast\'s death as my own, taking the reward for my own use.  It is wrong to claim a deed as your own that someone else in fact did.\n',620802),(6210,1,'I would show my liege the beast\'s ear and claim the beast\'s death as my own - after all, I did slay it.  I would then offer some of the reward to the destitute knight to help his family.',620801),(6210,2,'I would remain silent about the kill and allow the knight to claim the reward to aid his family.',618703),(6211,0,'I\'d love to get one of those written fortunes you mentioned!  I\'ve got the space in my inventory for it.',6211),(6525,0,'Trick or Treat!',342),(6545,0,'I\'ll be back once I straighten this mess out.',6545),(6552,0,'Thanks for the information, Frankal.',6552),(6622,0,'I\'ll wait.',662201),(6644,0,'Teleport me to the lair of the Twin Emperors, please.',66441),(6644,1,'Please teleport me to the final chamber.',66442),(6658,0,'That would be wonderful! Thank you, Meridith.',665801),(6686,0,'I\'m ready!',668601),(6690,0,'May I have your report?',6690),(6691,0,'May I have your report?',6691),(6692,0,'May I have your report?',6692),(6763,0,'Sprinkle some of the reindeer dust onto Metzen.',6763),(6918,0,'I\'d like a new invitation to the Lunar Festival.',6918),(6928,0,'I have lost my Band of Unending Life. Are you able to replace it for me?',43),(6928,1,'I have lost my Band of Vaulted Secrets. Are you able to replace it for me?',44),(6928,2,'I have lost my Band of Veiled Shadows. Are you able to replace it for me?',45),(6928,3,'I have lost my Ring of Eternal Justice. Are you able to replace it for me?',46),(6928,4,'I have lost my Ring of Infinite Wisdom. Are you able to replace it for me?',47),(6928,5,'I have lost my Ring of the Gathering Storm. Are you able to replace it for me?',48),(6928,6,'I have lost my Ring of Unspoken Names. Are you able to replace it for me?',49),(6928,7,'I have lost my Signet of the Unseen Path. Are you able to replace it for me?',50),(6928,8,'I have lost my Signet of Unyielding Strength. Are you able to replace it for me?',51),(6981,